TITLE:: FluidModelAnalyser
summary:: Placeholder for a configurable analysis stage (not implemented)
categories:: Libraries>FluidModel
related:: Classes/FluidModel, Classes/FluidModelSlicer

DESCRIPTION::
FluidModelAnalyser is an empty class, reserved for a future object that would choose and configure the analyses link::Classes/FluidModel:: runs on each slice, the way link::Classes/FluidModelSlicer:: does for slicing. It has no methods yet.

The analysis is currently fixed: see link::Classes/FluidModel#-analyze:: and the Descriptors section of link::Classes/FluidModel::.
